\ A raise inside a `choose` predicate, pinned interpreted. The interpreter runs the prelude
\ compound, so its chain carries the prelude-internal `call` row. The compiled `choose`
\ intrinsic inlines the predicate invocation and renders without that row; the eager and AOT
\ suites both run eager_error_frames_choose.1z against one shared golden.

pick-bigger: ( a b -- x ) [ [ + 0 > ] choose 0 + ] ;

1 "x" pick-bigger .
